# Static-asset security headers — Anthropic Addresses #369.
# Decision record: docs/operations/static-asset-security-headers.md
# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets applies these to every asset and SPA response.
# /api/* is answered by the Release Gateway Worker and is not affected by this file.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
